sign vision.</p>\n<p>Stand details<br />\nStand: 1.1C10 &amp; 1.1B01 — Canton Fair Complex, Guangzhou<br />\nDates: 18 – 21 March 2026<br />\nEdition: 30 Year Anniversary</p>\n<p>To arrange your visit, please register here:</p>\n</div><div class=\"fusion-form fusion-form-builder fusion-form-form-wrapper fusion-form-7316 has-icon-alignment\" style=\"--awb-tooltip-text-color:#ffffff;--awb-tooltip-background-color:#333333;--awb-field-margin-bottom:0px;--awb-form-input-height:50px;--awb-form-font-size:17px;--awb-form-placeholder-color:hsla(var(--awb-color6-h),var(--awb-color6-s),var(--awb-color6-l),calc(var(--awb-color6-a) - 50%));--awb-form-text-color:var(--awb-color6);--awb-form-border-width-top:1px;--awb-form-border-width-bottom:1px;--awb-form-border-width-right:1px;--awb-form-border-width-left:1px;--awb-form-border-color:var(--awb-color5);--awb-form-focus-border-color:var(--awb-color7);--awb-form-focus-border-hover-color:hsla(var(--awb-color7-h),var(--awb-color7-s),var(--awb-color7-l),calc(var(--awb-color7-a) - 50%));--awb-form-border-radius:8px;--awb-icon-alignment-top:1px;--awb-icon-alignment-bottom:1px;--awb-icon-alignment-font-size:17px;\" data-form-id=\"7316\" data-config=\"{&quot;form_id&quot;:&quot;7316&quot;,&quot;form_post_id&quot;:&quot;7316&quot;,&quot;post_id&quot;:7310,&quot;form_type&quot;:&quot;ajax&quot;,&quot;confirmation_type&quot;:&quot;message&quot;,&quot;redirect_url&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;field_labels&quot;:{&quot;YourName&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;email&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;Phone \\/ WhatsApp&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;Company or Organisation&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot; I would like to receive the Maison Debrah newsletter with collection updates, inspiration, events and brand news. I understand that I can unsubscribe at any time.&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;_i_would_like_to_receive_the_maison_debrah_newsletter_with_collection_updates_inspiration_events_and_brand_news_i_understand_that_i_can_unsubscribe_at_any_time&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;field